.SS "pip\&._vendor\&.distlib\&.database\&.EggInfoDistribution\&.check_installed_files ( self)"

.PP
.nf
Checks that the hashes and sizes of the files in ``RECORD`` are
matched by the files themselves\&. Returns a (possibly empty) list of
mismatches\&. Each entry in the mismatch list will be a tuple consisting
of the path, 'exists', 'size' or 'hash' according to what didn't match
(existence is checked first, then size, then hash), the expected
value and the actual value\&.

.fi
.PP
 
.SS "pip\&._vendor\&.distlib\&.database\&.EggInfoDistribution\&.list_distinfo_files ( self,  absolute = \fCFalse\fP)"

.PP
.nf
Iterates over the ``installed-files\&.txt`` entries and returns paths for
each line if the path is pointing to a file located in the
``\&.egg-info`` directory or one of its subdirectories\&.

:parameter absolute: If *absolute* is ``True``, each returned path is
                  transformed into a local absolute path\&. Otherwise the
                  raw value from ``installed-files\&.txt`` is returned\&.
:type absolute: boolean
:returns: iterator of paths

.fi
.PP
 
.SS "pip\&._vendor\&.distlib\&.database\&.EggInfoDistribution\&.list_installed_files ( self)"

.PP
.nf
Iterates over the ``installed-files\&.txt`` entries and returns a tuple
``(path, hash, size)`` for each line\&.

:returns: a list of (path, hash, size)

.fi
.PP
 
